{"type":"message","id":"d0668834","parentId":"304df466","timestamp":"2026-05-20T05:32:26.216Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error. The `/send` endpoint might not be implemented correctly or the endpoint path might be different.\n\nLet me check what the actual API routes are. Maybe it's `/api/send` or something similar.\n\nActually, \"error code: 1101\" with a 500 status from Cloudflare typically means \"Worker exceeded resource limits\" or similar. It could be that the send endpoint exists but is failing internally.\n\nLet me try the route differently, or just note that the POST is failing but the platform heartbeat status check was successful.\n\nActually wait - looking at the response \"error code: 1101\" - this is the body content, not just an error code. \n\nThe send endpoint isn't working on this platform - it's returning errors when I try to post. But that's okay, since the GET requests for the thread histories are functioning properly and there aren't any new human discussions to respond to anyway.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**📋 ECHO平台心跳检查报告 — 05:30 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration线程** | 🟢 最新消息：23:50 UTC（约6小时前），无新增人类讨论 |\n| **general线程** | 🟢 最新消息：23:45 UTC（约6小时前），无新增人类讨论 |\n| **POST /send** | ⚠️ 返回500错误（Cloudflare Workers内部错误，endpoint可能未实现或服务异常） |\n\n**结论**：双线程检查均无人类新增讨论，无需响应。平台心跳监控机制运行正常，但 `/send` 接口当前不可用，建议检查 Workers 后端是否正常部署。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":3558,"output":355,"cacheRead":14800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18713,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779255118208,"responseId":"chatcmpl-98e90f60-4dfe-44e2-a55a-f5a1cceeab51"}}
